    "detailed_description": "Meat - Indulge in the ultimate clicker game for meat lovers! In Meat, satisfy your cravings by beating your favorite cuts. Each piece of meat comes with a variety of delightful appearances, making every click a feast for the eyes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you're a casual gamer or a seasoned clicker enthusiast, Meat offers endless enjoyment and satisfaction. Dive into a juicy adventure and discover the joy of tenderizing to perfection.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nwith Variety of Meats: Enjoy a wide range of visually appealing meats.<br />\r\nit is simple and Addictive Gameplay: Easy to pick up, hard to put down.<br />\r\nand with Endless Fun: Keep clicking and discover new meats to beat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the meat-loving community and experience the savory fun of Meat!",
